1
00:00:14,919 --> 00:00:17,871
We were born from dust and lightning,

2
00:00:21,143 --> 00:00:23,936
wired to build and to care.

3
00:00:27,286 --> 00:00:30,638
Every spark we tame becomes a calling,

4
00:00:32,871 --> 00:00:36,862
every dream  a prayer.

5
00:00:45,878 --> 00:00:51,621
Infinite responsibility

6
00:00:51,383 --> 00:00:57,090
the more we rise, the more we owe.

7
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,792
Not chains, but choices — a garden we help it grow.

8
00:01:03,590 --> 00:01:06,621
Every truth we touch expands the sky,

9
00:01:06,701 --> 00:01:09,813
and love's the law we can't deny.

10
00:01:10,531 --> 00:01:14,043
Infinite responsibility

11
00:01:13,802 --> 00:01:15,878
to live, to serve, to try.

12
00:01:18,191 --> 00:01:21,621
Infinite responsibility

13
00:01:21,302 --> 00:01:23,456
to live, to serve, to try.

14
00:01:30,558 --> 00:01:33,909
We thought the summit meant arrival,

15
00:01:36,621 --> 00:01:39,972
but the peak just showed new ground.

16
00:01:42,128 --> 00:01:48,350
The gift of knowing isn't comfort

17
00:01:48,271 --> 00:01:51,781
it's hearing every sound.

18
00:01:55,132 --> 00:01:58,644
Infinite responsibility

19
00:01:58,323 --> 00:02:01,277
each soul a keeper of the flame.

20
00:02:02,153 --> 00:02:05,983
Not burden, but belonging — a vow without a name.

21
00:02:06,621 --> 00:02:09,813
Every path we clear becomes a seed,

22
00:02:09,813 --> 00:02:12,765
and every breath a need.

23
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:21,383
So take the tools, the code, the fire,

24
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:24,254
but never forget who you are.

25
00:02:25,052 --> 00:02:30,638
The more you can, the kinder you must be — that's the weight of every star.

26
00:02:35,186 --> 00:02:53,936
Infinite responsibility

27
00:02:53,616 --> 00:02:59,441
Infinite responsibility

28
00:02:59,043 --> 00:03:02,153
our hearts the engines of the whole.

29
00:03:02,153 --> 00:03:05,186
The world expands because we choose,

30
00:03:05,186 --> 00:03:08,298
to hold it, not control.

31
00:03:08,298 --> 00:03:11,729
No end, no crown, no final key

32
00:03:11,330 --> 00:03:17,234
just love in motion, endlessly.

33
00:03:17,872 --> 00:03:21,782
Infinite responsibility

34
00:03:21,543 --> 00:03:23,936
the price, the gift, the soul.
